{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42584","headline":"题邓真人遗址 · 王元","name":"题邓真人遗址","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三千功满仙昇去，留得山前旧隐基。\n但见白云长掩映，不知浮世几兴衰。\n松稍风触霓旌动，椶叶霜沾鹤翅垂。\n近代无人寻异事，野泉喷月泻秋池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}